  _nodes:
  - _nodeId: contact
    _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f6bad41a0c425844891d095685f8529, type: 2}
    _text: "Mert'in son temas giri\u015Fimi: EREN VARDAR."
    _nextNodeId: absence
    _choices: []
    _actions: []
  - _nodeId: absence
    _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f6bad41a0c425844891d095685f8529, type: 2}
    _text: "Arama \xF6l\xFCmden k\u0131sa s\xFCre \xF6nce yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015F.
      Benim cihaz\u0131mda kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131k gelen hi\xE7bir kay\u0131t yok."
    _nextNodeId: identifier
    _choices: []
    _actions: []
  - _nodeId: identifier
    _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f6bad41a0c425844891d095685f8529, type: 2}
    _text: "Foto\u011Fraf, silinen bellek blo\u011Fu ve bozuk dosya ayn\u0131 i\u015Farete
      \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor: NLP-0417."
    _nextNodeId: hook
    _choices: []
    _actions: []
  - _nodeId: hook
    _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f6bad41a0c425844891d095685f8529, type: 2}
    _text: "Mert beni arad\u0131. Beni tan\u0131yordu. Ben neden hi\xE7birini hat\u0131rlam\u0131yorum?"
